1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,543
I woke up this morning, and something

2
00:00:02,543 --> 00:00:04,902
was seriously wrong with the world.

3
00:00:04,902 --> 00:00:07,279
A bird was flying backward.

4
00:00:07,279 --> 00:00:09,672
The rain was falling up into the sky.

5
00:00:09,672 --> 00:00:11,809
And my neighbor had been standing in

6
00:00:11,809 --> 00:00:13,768
the exact same position for three

7
00:00:13,768 --> 00:00:15,786
hours, with one leg inside a wall.

8
00:00:15,786 --> 00:00:18,043
I thought I was losing my mind.

9
00:00:18,043 --> 00:00:20,545
Then I tried to open my front door.

10
00:00:20,545 --> 00:00:22,963
It led to the middle of the ocean.

11
00:00:22,963 --> 00:00:25,422
I slammed it shut, opened it again, and

12
00:00:25,422 --> 00:00:28,133
suddenly I was standing
in a grocery store.

13
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:30,461
Every single item had my face on it.

14
00:00:30,461 --> 00:00:31,702
Even the milk.

15
00:00:31,702 --> 00:00:34,335
I decided the smartest
thing to do was stay

16
00:00:34,335 --> 00:00:36,907
inside and wait for reality to fix itself.

17
00:00:36,907 --> 00:00:38,664
Terrible decision.

18
00:00:38,664 --> 00:00:41,244
At exactly noon, the sky turned blue and a

19
00:00:41,244 --> 00:00:43,947
giant error message
appeared above the city.

20
00:00:43,947 --> 00:00:47,510
REALITY UPDATE FAILED.
RESTARTING IN 100 DAYS.

21
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:49,412
Then everyone froze.

22
00:00:49,412 --> 00:00:50,713
Everyone except me.

23
00:00:50,713 --> 00:00:53,917
I walked outside and
waved my hand in front

24
00:00:53,917 --> 00:00:56,599
of a frozen police officer. Nothing.

25
00:00:56,599 --> 00:00:59,500
I threw a rock at a
car, and the rock turned

26
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,072
into a chicken halfway through the air.

27
00:01:02,072 --> 00:01:04,558
I was about to celebrate my new life as

28
00:01:04,558 --> 00:01:06,980
the world's most powerful idiot when I

29
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:09,274
noticed something across the street.

30
00:01:09,274 --> 00:01:10,935
A second stickman.

31
00:01:10,935 --> 00:01:12,764
He was moving, too.

32
00:01:12,764 --> 00:01:15,575
He stared directly at me, pointed toward

33
00:01:15,575 --> 00:01:17,894
the sky, and mouthed three words.

34
00:01:17,894 --> 00:01:19,431
You're not real.

35
00:01:19,431 --> 00:01:21,132
Then he disappeared.

36
00:01:21,132 --> 00:01:23,515
A countdown appeared above my head.

37
00:01:23,515 --> 00:01:25,532
99 days, 23 hours, 59 minutes.

38
00:01:25,532 --> 00:01:28,289
And suddenly, I had a much bigger problem

39
00:01:28,289 --> 00:01:30,845
than backward birds and chicken rocks.

40
00:01:30,845 --> 00:01:32,767
I had to figure out who created

41
00:01:32,767 --> 00:01:34,689
this world before it restarted.

42
00:01:34,689 --> 00:01:36,838
Because something tells me the next

43
00:01:36,838 --> 00:01:38,803
update isn't going to be pretty.

44
00:01:38,803 --> 00:01:40,723
So, what should I do first?

45
00:01:40,723 --> 00:01:42,789
A: Break into the mysterious

46
00:01:42,789 --> 00:01:45,372
building where the countdown began.

47
00:01:45,372 --> 00:01:48,665
B: Find the stickman
who said I'm not real.

48
00:01:48,665 --> 00:01:50,326
Choose carefully.

49
00:01:50,326 --> 00:01:52,126
We've got 100 days to figure out

50
00:01:52,126 --> 00:01:53,645
what the hell is happening.

